WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Raw Drive Rush approaches Ryu from neutral.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.800
Back heavy punch hits during the Rush approach.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching heavy punch links after back heavy.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.900
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.900
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the conversion.

6
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Heavy Flash Knuckle finishes the juggle.
